  "material": true,
  "note": "Mentions N-1 but Charlie Kirk is not named or referred to in the claim. Host: 'I did not hear that it was 40 people, but I did hear that it was a lot of people... It sounded like 15'; 'revises' overstates.",
  "fix": {
